<meta name="description" content="Response curves, expo, and deadzones for joysticks, HOTAS, gamepads, and wheels on Linux. Invert, swap, and combine axes in the kernel with HID-BPF, for every game, also in Proton and Wine.">
<link rel="canonical" href="@SITE_URL@">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
