<meta property="og:title" content="xmorpheo: response curves and deadzones for joysticks, gamepads, and wheels on Linux">
<meta property="og:description" content="Curves, deadzones, and remapped axes for any HID input device, applied in the kernel with HID-BPF, so they work in every game, native or in Proton and Wine.">
